msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"This analysis performs a Cox proportional hazards regression, a statistical "
"method used in survival analysis to examine the relationship between the "
"time until an event occurs (such as death or failure) and one or more "
"predictor variables. It helps you understand how different factors influence "
"the risk or hazard of the event happening at any given time. The Cox model "
"is particularly useful because it can handle censored data (when the event "
"has not occurred for some subjects during the study period) and does not "
"require assumptions about the baseline hazard function."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval Start"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the start time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Interval End"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the end time of the observation "
"interval. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Counting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Time to Event"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the variable that represents the time until the event or censoring "
"occurs. Only available when Censoring Type is set to Right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Status"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Choose the variable that indicates the event status, specifying whether each "
"observation is an event or censored."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Event Indicator"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Specify the value in the Event Status variable that indicates the occurrence "
"of the event."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "Covariables"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add continuous variables as covariates to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Añadir variables continuas como covariables para incluirlas en el modelo de "
"regresión de Cox."

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Factors"
msgstr "Factores"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Add categorical variables as factors to include them in the Cox regression "
"model."
msgstr ""
"Añadir variables con categorías como factores para incluirlas en el modelo "
"de regresión de Cox."

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Weights"
msgstr "Ponderaciones"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select a variable for case weights, weighting each observation accordingly "
"in the model."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar una variable para las ponderaciones de los casos, ponderando "
"cada observación como corresponde en el modelo."

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring Type"
msgstr "Tipo de censura"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Select the type of censoring in your data: Right censoring or Counting "
"process."
msgstr ""
"Seleccionar el tipo de censura en sus datos: censura por la derecha o "
"proceso de recuento."

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "Derecha"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Counting"
msgstr "Recontar"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid "Censoring summary"
msgstr "Resumen de censura"

msgctxt "SemiParametricSurvivalAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Create a summary table with information about the censoring status of the "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Generar una tabla resumen con información sobre el estado de censura en los "
"datos."

